              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CRYSTALANNE79"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So easy to make and tastes great! I added frozen corn and peas as well and it turned out fantastic! The best part is...no dishes!",
            "datePublished": "2004-12-22T10:38:08.077Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
